WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
An example creative opens Mar de Fondo's own website.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.200
The booking panel checks availability and compares options with visible pricing.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:15.000
The breakdown updates when an extra is added and the unit is held during the form.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:24.500
The demonstration booking ends with a simulated-payment receipt and no charge.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.500
Reception operates a sample planner containing 300 units.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:38.800
The recommendation shows sources, range and confidence; the prototype makes no changes.
